<https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/18/msa@/~cl_7> <https://schema.org/text> "seksyen 17 seksyen yang berikut: Regard to 17A. In the interpretation of a provision of an be had Act, a construction that would promote the to the purpose purpose or object underlying the Act (whether of Act. that purpose or object is expressly stated in the Act or not) shall be preferred to a construction that would not promote that purpose or object.\"."@ms <https://cheeleong.dev/data-parlimen/akn/my/bill/dr/1997/18/msa@> .
